{"id": "garvey-coop-bookkeeping-and-accruals", "title": "A San Francisco housing co-op paid $24,054 in bookkeeping fees auditors questioned", "seconds": 51.3, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "19373eb1e377713c", "words": 146, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At a San Francisco housing cooperative, auditors questioned $24,054 of bookkeeping fees.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.33, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Bookkeeping", "without", "recorded", "approval"], "sub": "The agreement required board approval"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Invoices over $1,000 needed board approval under the agreement.", "t0": 6.45, "t1": 10.2, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,000", "label": "The agreement required board approval"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The auditors found no indication of approval for the bookkeeping.", "t0": 10.32, "t1": 13.34, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fee", "layout": "table", "heading": "Bookkeeping fee", "context": "Board approval", "rows": [{"label": "Approval required", "value": "Over $1,000"}, {"label": "Separate invoice", "value": "$24,054"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The full bill included property management and payroll processing.", "t0": 13.56, "t1": 16.79, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "expenses", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2021 fees", "context": "King–Garvey Square Apartments", "rows": [{"label": "Management", "value": "$159,516"}, {"label": "Bookkeeping", "value": "$24,054"}, {"label": "Payroll processing", "value": "$4,200"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Those three charges totaled $187,770.", "t0": 16.91, "t1": 21.38, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$187,770", "label": "Fees identified in the accounts"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The board said it was working on a resolution.", "t0": 21.5, "t1": 23.7, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "expenses", "kicker": "Fees identified in the accounts", "text": "Proposed resolution", "mark": "Proposed"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Another finding concerned $419,460 of expenses missing from the closing accounts.", "t0": 23.82, "t1": 29.99, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$419,460", "label": "Separate accrued costs at the change of manager"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Mortgage interest accounted for $219,842.", "t0": 30.11, "t1": 34.46, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "accrual", "layout": "table", "heading": "Year-end accrued costs", "context": "King–Garvey Square Apartments", "rows": [{"label": "Initially omitted", "value": "$419,460"}, {"label": "Mortgage interest", "value": "$219,842"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Management said it paid the mortgage on time.", "t0": 34.58, "t1": 36.7, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accrual", "kicker": "Separate accrued costs at the change of manager", "text": "Mortgage payment", "mark": "Mortgage"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "An older $192,520 interest correction concerned a different loan.", "t0": 36.92, "t1": 42.2, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "early", "kicker": "Earlier interest and two tenant-file exceptions", "text": "Earlier HUD loan", "mark": "Earlier"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The following audit marked that older issue completed.", "t0": 42.32, "t1": 44.81, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "early", "kicker": "Earlier interest and two tenant-file exceptions", "text": "Earlier correction", "mark": "Earlier"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The actual board resolution would answer the bookkeeping question.", "t0": 44.93, "t1": 48.05, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "early", "kicker": "Earlier interest and two tenant-file exceptions", "text": "Board resolution", "mark": "Board"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.17, "t1": 50.39, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The agreement required board approval", "b": "Fees identified in the accounts", "o": "Earlier interest and two tenant-file exceptions"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}